              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "grex, gregis — \"a flock, a herd; a band of people\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pastor gregem ovium ad flūmen dūcit. The shepherd leads the flock of sheep to the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Third declension, masculine: grex, gregis m. Also a group of people. English gregarious, congregate and egregious (out of the flock) come from it."
            }
          ]
        },
